OL,3,GNEWSATory MP questions government
OL,4,Aadvisor's position after wife's
OL,5,APalestine Action post
OL,6,
OL,7,FConservative MP Alicia Kearns has
OL,8,Fraised concerns over whether Jonathan
OL,9,FPowell, the National Security Advisor,
OL,10,Fcan remain in his post following his
OL,11,Fwife's references to Palestine Action
OL,12,Fon social media.
OL,14,FThe shadow home affairs minister has
OL,15,Fwritten to the prime minister
OL,16,Fquestioning whether Powell's position
OL,17,Fis still tenable, despite the
OL,18,FMetropolitan Police concluding no
OL,19,Faction was necessary over his wife's,
OL,20,FSarah Helm, comments.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
