OL,3,GNEWSATory MP questions government
OL,4,Aadvisor's position after wife's
OL,5,APalestine Action post
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Downing Street spokeswoman told the
OL,8,FBBC: "These views are held by an
OL,9,Findividual who does not represent the
OL,10,Fgovernment in any capacity."
OL,12,FPosting on X last Thursday, Helm wrote:
OL,13,F"God help us authors who support
OL,14,FPalestine and Palestine Action,"
OL,15,Fresponding to a discussion about the
OL,16,Fauthor Sally Rooney.
